# GD-24 (round 19, writer 10): settled; was REFCORE-UNSPECIFIED §2.4. L §2.4: rules by their own governs as rows are: a span with no start before one with a start.
# The old comment:
# L §2.4 sorts rules "then by the start of their own governs"; a rule governing `..2026` has no start, and where it sorts
# against one of its label that has one is not stated for rules: REFCORE-UNSPECIFIED.
=== options reprint
=== m.tally
model m
  tally 2
  on 2026-10-20
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-12-31

def f: int
  rule a governs 2027.. = 2
  rule a governs ..2026 = 1
